can be a single dimension, list of dimensions, or ``None`` to reduce over all
dimensions.

The variance (:math:`\sigma^2`) is calculated as

.. math:: \sigma^2 = \frac{1}{\max(0,~N - \delta N)}\sum_{i=0}^{N-1}(x_i-\bar{x})^2

